      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Is it about me?\r\n- Currently, I am serving as the\r\nassistant to the clan chief.\r\nIf nothing goes wrong, I was supposed to be the\r\nhead guardian of the Spirit Dragon.",
        "Jp" : "わたしのことか？\r\n――今は族長補佐をしているが\r\n何事も無ければ、精霊竜の守番長を\r\n務める予定だったのだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 521630,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
