      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "If I am to serve as the Chief Guardian, I won't\r\nbe able to return to the village for a while.\r\nWhile I'm here in the village, I intend to work\r\nmy hardest as the Deputy Chief.",
        "Jp" : "守番長として務め始めれば\r\nしばらく村には帰って来られない\r\n村にいる間は精一杯族長補佐として働くつもりだ"
